"""
weird - Process Anomaly Detector

Identifies suspicious processes by:
- Detecting processes with unusual names or behavior
- Verifying package provenance (binary -> package -> repo -> signing key)
- Inspecting ambiguous processes to understand what they're doing
- Checking if flagged PIDs have network connections
"""
